    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Kirby-inspired 2D platformer game where you can absorb the aliens that try to attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Something odd has arrived and is taking the color away\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A race of extraterrestrial beings known as the Voidlings crash onto earth. Keena befriends a lone Voidling she calls Moku which accompanies her on her journey to save her brother. Like the other Voidlings, Moku can absorb  objects and use their likeness to navigate the world in different ways. Join Keena and Moku as they join forces in Keena the Voidslayer!</p>",
